	(text "I2C Addr:\nBaro - 0x77 high or 0x76 if SDO low\nMag - 0x30\n\nSPI Addr:\nAccel - WHO_AM_I register at 0x75, which reads 0x47\nFlash - Manufacturer/Device ID can be read with the JEDEC ID command (0x9F): \nreturns EFh (Winbond), 40h, 18h / EF 40 18 for this chip\n\nOSD - MAX7456 has an ID register at 0x00, which reads 0x01.\n"
