	(text "<@343835524592566272> <@649363262634459157> \n## Schematic review notes for future revisions that require re-wiring:\n- PC13, PC14 and PC15 shouldn't be used to sink/source more than ~20mW according to the STM datasheet - if your LEDs are rated below that, it should be fine, but we generally don't allow this for official targets ([Relevant Betaflight Guidelines](https://betaflight.com/docs/development/manufacturer/manufacturer-design-guidelines#3146-leds))\n- The first four motors should ideally be on the same GPIO port and timer, right now they are on two GPIO ports and at least two timers ([Relevant Betaflight Guidelines](https://betaflight.com/docs/development/manufacturer/manufacturer-design-guidelines#32-resource-selection-considerations))\n- We strongly recommend implementing the [Betaflight Connector Standard](https://betaflight.com/docs/development/manufacturer/connector-standard)\n- It's generally better to use a switching regulator for the 5V stage instead of an LDO\n- I'm 99% sure that the BMP581 barometer isn't supported by Betaflight. We recommend the DPS368\n\n## Review notes that can be reasonably hacked together with what you have, or with what is easy and/or cheap to get:\n- When using the ICM-42688-P IMU, it's required to use a separate LDO to power it, to ensure a clean power supply and good readings. ([Relevant Betaflight Guidelines](https://betaflight.com/docs/development/manufacturer/manufacturer-design-guidelines#advised-power-supply-design-for-icm-42xxx-imu-also-applies-to-others))\n- The battery voltage resistor divider should use 100k/10k resistors\n- The ADC inputs for battery voltage and current sensor should have bypass capacitors ([Relevant Betaflight Guidelines](https://betaflight.com/docs/development/manufacturer/manufacturer-design-guidelines#3142-adc-circuitry-eg-for-vbat-and-current-sensors))\n- It's generally better to not have the MCU run as HSI, HSE with an external 8MHz crystal is preferred"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 929.386 419.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "dc242912-315d-4707-aa5a-6cbe7f0e6127")
	)
